. * ============================
. * Sample Restriction
. * ============================
. 
. * Keep only respondents with at least one child
. * keep if pld0172 >= 1
. 
. * ============================
. * Clean and Prepare Variables
. * ============================
. 
. * Set invalid response codes to missing for key variables
. foreach var in plj0620 plj0621 plj0622 {
  2.     replace `var' = . if `var' < 0
  3. }
(26,747 real changes made, 26,747 to missing)
(26,743 real changes made, 26,743 to missing)
(26,746 real changes made, 26,746 to missing)

.  
. * Rescale plj0621 and plj0622 from 1–7 to 0–10
. gen plj0621_r = (plj0621 - 1) * (10/6)
(34,865 missing values generated)

. gen plj0622_r = (plj0622 - 1) * (10/6)
(34,868 missing values generated)

. 
. * Construct Gender Equality Index (DV)
. gen gender_eq_index = (plj0620 + plj0621_r + plj0622_r) / 3
(34,882 missing values generated)

. 
. * Generate 'daughter' dummy: 1 if at least one daughter among kidsex01–kidsex
> 19
. gen daughter = 0

. foreach var of varlist kidsex01-kidsex19 {
  2.     replace daughter = 1 if `var' == 2
  3. }
